      "comment": "Lewis &amp; Short: “to throw across”; Caesar writes <span lang=\"la\">trānsiciō</span>. Traupman: <span lang=\"la\">corbifollem trānsjicere</span> in basketball, <span lang=\"la\">pedifollem trājicere ad</span> (+ acc.) in American football, <span lang=\"la\">disculum trājicere</span> in hockey."
