      "status": "alternative",
      "period": "modern",
      "gloss": "pass (the ball)",
      "evidence": [
        "Traupman 357"
      ],
      "comment": "Classically “send across, convey over”; Traupman uses it of passing the ball, and <span lang=\"la\">pedifollis trānsmissus</span> for a pass."
